mode generate
option trials 1
option show_easy 1

triangle A B C
midpoint M A B
incenter I A B C

# A and R are mirror images across the perpendicular bisector of BC. Hence
# AR is parallel to BC and BACR is an isosceles trapezoid.
perp_bisector p B C
reflection_line R A p

# F and D see the same diameter AC under right angles.
line AB A B
line BC B C
foot F C AB
foot D A BC
